title: Close card
subtitle: The Committee action stays used; closing the card costs nothing more.
view-if: last_advisor_action = 1 or last_cabinet_action = 1
go-to: root
on-arrival: {!
// An adviser action is final once chosen (technical reference 4.3): nothing is refunded. Closing
// the card only undoes what the card itself recorded when it opened.
PolishRules.closeCard(Q, this.state);
!}
